WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:13.511
Bello: I feel funny.

2
00:00:13.512 --> 00:00:15.712
Chuck: Me too.

3
00:00:15.713 --> 00:00:17.778
Dave: Me three.

4
00:00:17.779 --> 00:00:22.381
Brad: We need some light to see what happened.

5
00:00:22.382 --> 00:00:25.871
Mr. Joseph: Okay, Bradley, what is going on in here?

6
00:00:25.872 --> 00:00:28.782
Brad: I . . . I'm not sure.

7
00:00:28.783 --> 00:00:31.984
I guess a fuse must have blown.

8
00:00:31.985 --> 00:00:33.456
Mr. Joseph: A fuse?

9
00:00:33.457 --> 00:00:36.248
Tina: Yes. Some water spilled.

10
00:00:36.249 --> 00:00:39.665
We think it hit something electrical.

11
00:00:39.666 --> 00:00:41.765
Mr. Joseph: Tina, is that you?

12
00:00:41.766 --> 00:00:43.348
Tina: Yes, it's me.

13
00:00:43.349 --> 00:00:45.491
Mr. Joseph: Danny . . . are you here too?

14
00:00:45.492 --> 00:00:47.946
Danny: Yes, I'm right here.

15
00:00:47.947 --> 00:00:49.962
Mrs. Rice: Where's the giant?

16
00:00:49.963 --> 00:00:51.881
Brad: What giant?

17
00:00:51.882 --> 00:00:55.336
Tina: There's no giant here.

18
00:00:55.337 --> 00:00:57.331
Mr. Joseph: Let me check the fuse box.

19
00:00:57.332 --> 00:01:01.814
It's too dark in here.

20
00:01:01.815 --> 00:01:05.207
Mr. Joseph: That's better. Now I can see.

21
00:01:05.208 --> 00:01:08.064
Tina & Danny: Hello, Mr. Joseph.

22
00:01:08.065 --> 00:01:12.186
Mr. Joseph: Hello, kids. Who are your two friends?

23
00:01:12.187 --> 00:01:14.121
Mrs. Rice: Look! I was right!

24
00:01:14.122 --> 00:01:19.702
It's a giant! Call the police!

25
00:01:19.703 --> 00:01:21.672
Mrs. Rice: It's dark again!

26
00:01:21.673 --> 00:01:23.557
Mr. Joseph: This is ridiculous.

27
00:01:23.558 --> 00:01:25.733
I'm going to get a flashlight.

28
00:01:25.734 --> 00:01:27.570
Mrs. Rice: What about the giant?

29
00:01:27.571 --> 00:01:28.760
Mr. Joseph: Come with me.

30
00:01:28.761 --> 00:01:32.747
We'll be right back.

31
00:01:32.748 --> 00:01:35.719
Bello: Just a second.

32
00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:38.042
Tina: That was quick thinking, Bello.

33
00:01:38.043 --> 00:01:39.881
Bello: I had to do something.

34
00:01:39.882 --> 00:01:44.509
Brad: Quick, somebody close the door.

35
00:01:44.510 --> 00:01:48.817
Chuck: Whoa. So you really are a giant!

36
00:01:48.818 --> 00:01:50.441
Dave: That's so cool.

37
00:01:50.442 --> 00:01:56.214
We've never seen a giant before.

38
00:01:56.215 --> 00:01:58.204
Chuck: We're not dreaming.

39
00:01:58.205 --> 00:02:00.214
Dave: This is just awesome.

40
00:02:00.215 --> 00:02:03.702
Bello: Now, you must promise never to tell anyone about me.

41
00:02:03.703 --> 00:02:08.086
Bello: This will be your secret with Tina, Brad, and Danny.

42
00:02:08.087 --> 00:02:11.758
Bello: Only you five will ever know about the land of Ginormous.

43
00:02:11.759 --> 00:02:15.223
Chuck & Dave: We promise.

44
00:02:15.224 --> 00:02:21.956
Bello: If you ever do tell anybody, I may come back in a very, very bad mood.

45
00:02:21.957 --> 00:02:26.335
Bello: You won't like it, I promise you.

46
00:02:26.336 --> 00:02:32.480
Tina: That's pretty funny, Bello.

47
00:02:32.481 --> 00:02:35.869
Chuck: Hey, why are you all laughing?

48
00:02:35.870 --> 00:02:40.131
Bello: I'm sorry. I wanted to see what it was like to be mean.

49
00:02:40.132 --> 00:02:42.581
Bello: I can't do it without laughing.

50
00:02:42.582 --> 00:02:46.488
Bello: Why were you two so mean to Danny and Brad?

51
00:02:46.489 --> 00:02:51.892
Dave: We kinda . . . we kinda like . . . Tina.

52
00:02:51.893 --> 00:02:54.137
But just as a friend.

53
00:02:54.138 --> 00:02:57.231
Danny: You were jealous!

54
00:02:57.232 --> 00:03:03.577
Chuck: We wanted Tina to play with us, but she was [n3@always playing with you and Brad.

55
00:03:03.578 --> 00:03:07.274
Tina: Why didn't you just ask to play with us?

56
00:03:07.275 --> 00:03:11.364
Chuck: We thought you'd say no.

57
00:03:11.365 --> 00:03:16.730
Brad: So Tina had the power all along!
